From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Describe the MT6357 battery gauge

Add a gauge child binding with explicit shunt and calibration units.
Register the binding under the MT6357 MFD.

---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mfd/mediatek,mt6357.yaml   |    6 ++
 .../power/supply/mediatek,mt6357-gauge.yaml        |   52 ++++++++++++++++++++
 MAINTAINERS                                        |    5 ++
 3 files changed, 63 insertions(+)

